{"kind":"request","text":"OPS-2: the deploy command and the smoke command cover the sandbox\nWorker.\n\nscripts/deploy.mjs deploys grow, lending, demo and artroom-scope.\nThe sandbox Worker dap-application-sandbox has no place in it. Its\nsource apps/sandbox/worker.ts changed on 3 and 8 November, and the\nrunning version stayed at 64f472f7 from 23 October until today. I\ndeployed it by hand at 06:37 on 12 November with wrangler 4.147.0\nand --keep-vars from apps/sandbox/wrangler.rollout.jsonc. The new\nversion is 12a88599, bundle be14bc37. END assert 6ba47e5e records it.\n\nAdd a fifth name, sandbox, to scripts/deploy.mjs:\n\n- It builds from apps/sandbox/wrangler.rollout.jsonc with the same\n  pinned wrangler.\n- It writes a receipt of the same form as the other four: commit,\n  bundle digest, version, time.\n- It refuses, like the others, when the dry-run bundle equals the\n  bundle in the previous receipt.\n- The first receipt may start from --deployed with the commit\n  221e11c33428068e0b95ffaa30aa0d294186b3c0.\n\nAdd sandbox to scripts/deploy-smoke.mjs. The Worker has no /health\nroute, so the smoke reads what it serves:\n\n- GET / on a mapped host gives 404.\n- GET /site/x and GET /applications/x give 404.\n- GET /v1/scopes/\u003cmapped room\u003e gives 403 with the body\n  {\"ok\":false,\"reason\":\"forbidden\"}.\n- GET / on an unmapped host gives 404.\n\nThe command takes the host and the room from arguments. It names no\nroom in source.\n\nUpdate the deployment section of docs/operate-a-service.md in the\nsame head: five names, one command.\n\nTests: the existing deploy script tests gain the fifth name. No\nlive deployment by the builder. The planner runs the first real\nsandbox deployment through the command.\n\nOrder: after S4. It may share a gate with F-2 or S1-F.","body":{"conditions":"One small head on main with the named tests. Gate once. Checker review before landing.","target_head":"221e11c33428068e0b95ffaa30aa0d294186b3c0","target_ref":"refs/heads/